WEBVTT

00:04:00.833 --> 00:04:03.101
I didn't want to be a person who left.

00:04:03.125 --> 00:04:05.167
I wanted to be a person who stayed.

00:04:06.333 --> 00:04:09.268
On the other hand, I was lonely and tired.

00:04:09.292 --> 00:04:12.750
And so I convinced myself
that I could do more change

00:04:14.125 --> 00:04:17.708
on a larger scale if I had
a prestigious law degree.

00:04:19.541 --> 00:04:20.791
So I left.

00:04:22.750 --> 00:04:24.351
Three years later,

00:04:24.375 --> 00:04:26.768
when I was about
to graduate from law school,

00:04:26.792 --> 00:04:28.518
my friend called me

00:04:28.542 --> 00:04:33.458
and told me that Patrick
had got into a fight and killed someone.